### 3. End-to-End Test — [test_pipeline_e2e.py](file:///c:/programe/GitHub/U-hack/llm-integration/tests/test_pipeline_e2e.py)

13 test cases in `TestPipelineE2E` class, covering:

- **Structural**: payload validates, round-trips through JSON, 5 panels present
- **Per-panel**: xT grid is 12×16, danger creator has primary, 3+ vulnerability alerts, goal DNA has pattern, verdict has 4 phases
- **Honest Panel D**: verifies source ordering `[xt_engine, zones, goal_dna, verdict]`
- **Cross-panel**: alert zone IDs in 0..191, primary danger creator has non-negative xT

> [!NOTE]
> All e2e tests are **skipped** when `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, or `SUPABASE_TEST_MATCH_ID` are missing. This is by design — they require a live Supabase match already processed by the cloud function.

